Package: luci-app-xboxaccel
Version: 1.2.0-1
Depends: libc, luci-base, curl
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 16
Section: luci
License: Apache-2.0
Maintainer: xboxaccel
Description: Xbox download CDN selector for OpenWrt.
 Keeps separate primary and legacy addresses, suppresses AAAA for those names, and checks dnsmasq before leaving a new record in place.
 International download names are answered with an HTTP redirect to the .cn host instead of being pinned to the CDN address.
